## Interface: 16001
## Title: Mint Bridge
## Notes: The in-game side of Minty's Community Manager. Scans your equipped gear and talents and turns them into a string you paste on the guild website's Roster page.
## Author: Zack
## Version: 0.1.0
## SavedVariables: MintBridgeDB
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Note_01
## X-License: MIT
## X-Website: https://github.com/wongz1/mint-community-tools

# 16001 = WoW Forever beta client 1.60.1 (major * 10000 + minor * 100 + patch). Other addons
# with this number load on the beta client without "out of date" warnings. To read the real
# number in game:  /mint debug   (or /run print((select(4, GetBuildInfo()))) ).
# If the addon ever shows as out of date after a patch, tick "Load out of date AddOns" on the
# AddOns screen at character select.

